    "sentence_translations": [
      "Beer Belly",
      "",
      "“I can’t drink alcohol anymore. Look, I already have a beer belly.”",
      "At the drinking table, we can often hear this type of conversation.",
      "“Beer belly” is especially common among older men who often must join social parties and drink alcohol.",
      "",
      "A lot of people believe that beer belly is due to frequently drinking beer.",
      "But actually, whether you get beer belly from drinking beer or not depends on the amount you drink.",
      "For men, 750 ml of beer per day, or 450 ml of beer for women, ..",
      ".. will normally not cause a beer belly, as long as you only eat light food after drinking, .",
      "",
      "If you want to get rid of a “beer belly”, you need to work hard in many aspects.",
      "For example, ordinarily only eat until you’re 70% full, work out for at least 30 minutes each day, ..",
      ".. take a warm shower before sleeping, and improving your sleeping environment.",
      ""
    ]
